WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.888
PUSH. Show a finger starting a toy car moving.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.717
PULL. Show a string drawing a small wagon nearer.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.123
MAGNET. Show an iron clip moving toward a magnet.

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.421
STOP. Show hands slowing a soft rolling ball to rest.
